WEBVTT

00:09:57.999 --> 00:10:01.227
where you talk about doing some shit.

00:10:01.227 --> 00:10:04.381
If you want to meet with me, come to the garden

00:10:04.381 --> 00:10:07.661
with your shovel so we can plant some shit.

00:10:07.661 --> 00:10:10.845
Peace. Thank you.

00:10:10.845 --> 00:10:14.989
(Applause)

00:10:14.989 --> 00:10:18.989
Thank you. (Applause)